<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Family Link Safety Test</title>

<style>
    body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #111827;
        color: white;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .box {
        max-width: 650px;
        margin: 20px;
        padding: 35px;
        background: #1f2937;
        border-radius: 18px;
        text-align: center;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
    }

    .warning {
        font-size: 55px;
    }

    h1 {
        color: #f87171;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .url {
        background: #111827;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        color: #fbbf24;
        word-break: break-all;
    }

    .lesson {
        text-align: left;
        background: #374151;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        margin-top: 25px;
    }

    li {
        margin: 12px 0;
    }

    .good {
        color: #4ade80;
    }

    .button {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        background: #2563eb;
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="box">

    <div class="warning">⚠️</div>

    <h1>HEY! YOU CLICKED A SUSPICIOUS LINK!</h1>

    <p>This was a <strong>family internet-safety test</strong>.</p>

    <div class="url">
        🔗 You clicked a link before checking where it went.
    </div>

    <h2>Don't panic. Here's what to do next.</h2>

    <div class="lesson">

        <h3>🛑 Before clicking a link:</h3>

        <ul>
            <li>Check the <strong>website address</strong>.</li>
            <li>Watch for misspellings like <strong>paypa1.com</strong>.</li>
            <li>Be suspicious of messages saying <strong>"ACT NOW!"</strong></li>
            <li>Don't enter passwords after following an unexpected link.</li>
            <li>When in doubt, open the company's website yourself instead.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="good">✅ Golden Rule</h3>

        <p>
            <strong>If you weren't expecting the link, don't click it.</strong>
        </p>

    </div>

    <a class="button" href="https://www.google.com">
        Continue Safely
    </a>

</div>

</body>
</html>
